{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach it. If reached, pickup object, check properties, do task. Else, scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Action ID = PickupObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = HasReachedDestination    /> <Action ID = CheckBattery    /> <Action ID = CheckSensors    /> <Action ID = CheckObstacles    />",
